%description:
Tests pushLastBufferedSegment, the PSH of RFC 9293 section 3.9.1.2 (MUST-61):
the SEND of INET has no PUSH flag, so the last buffered segment carries PSH. The
client sends 2500 bytes and, at t=3 s, 1000 bytes more, with an MSS of 1000.
Only the segments that empty the send queue carry PSH: A005, the last 500 bytes
of the first SEND, and A006, the second SEND.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 5s
*.cli_app.sendScript="1.0 2500; 3.0 1000"
*.*_tcp.mss = 1000
*.cli_tcp.pushLastBufferedSegment = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[1.001 A003] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1:1001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.203 B002] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1001 win 16384 
[1.205 A004] A.1000 > B.2000: A 1001:2001(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.407 B003] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2001 win 16384 
[1.409 A005] A.1000 > B.2000: A P 2001:2501(500) ack 501 win 16384 
[1.611 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 2501 win 16384 
[3.001 A006] A.1000 > B.2000: A P 2501:3501(1000) ack 501 win 16384 
[3.203 B005] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 3501 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
